External data sources
---------------------

The Source Capture pipeline queries Open Library, Microlink, CrossRef, YouTube
oEmbed, Twitter oEmbed, Wikidata and TVmaze. ShadowVault ships no API
credentials and bundles no data from these services. Metadata retrieved at
capture time is subject to each provider's own terms; it is fetched into the
user's local vault and is not redistributed by this project.


